<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-11-13T23:45:23.693Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 23:45:23 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Gunmen abducted six IDPs on their way to farms in Kaduna and killed a farmer there after receiving a N56 million ransom, while bandits killed a 3‑year-old girl in Zamfara following a kidnapping. Armed attackers assaulted Peter Obi opposition rallies and NDC supporters in Lagos, killing supporters and prompting a police probe. Troops ambushed and neutralised fourteen bandits in Katsina and police rescued a kidnapped child in Zamfara. The conflict recorded 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxQeEZocDhmNF9JMUJJZUZJTEROelQ4bFBlR0RNX3hHR3ExeHlGYnJ3Nm1HR3lCc3FoNU0tTXJUTDM0Qi1zMTMtYU5DNEF1Q0xLZWQ3YlFNNlFlQ01naUFvbnNGZE80NXZBT01tVDh3TXFSVXc2RU4tVklaanFiTWF5a214X1c2ZExmUXBpVklRX2pxODg?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxPX0RHTTNBUy1ScjJ4ekxwUXpTclJDRGZKSGM4cVR0Rnl6Qmozby1YM213czh1X3VEeDIwVmN0d2x3cWxCMXV4N2NORTl1Q2NBMTlzYXd5SEp2MlFNbVpSQjV6RThSUFFvTXlFTGxqMzhvYnpselNGRzRyOU5BNTMydUZxckpqUnVyOVhF?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxPRXl0bGNGR0tzcExjQnhpOEZVektucGhMOTYxSHNTelQ5dGktTmxZeV9jaHh2dGVTUF9HN2oxMndueVFyT0R4bF9uU09GMVpRUFIyM1FaMGJfZVVxTk9OM21BZG92bHktSmk1eXBzdlNUQ2tCMWZ1Z2gybmFKRnQ2V09rbEVXd0lJaTRMUk1RUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxOeWNTZ1pFc2Q4ZXFLY0hhN3RsWVpUZkhuUjl0aDFRbHBUczE2ckZuelppOTNjYXNHVWN5clFwemxfOFptbXE2X05MSlNtenFSNGluUW9fQ2dkbzlfRXpxRExTX0RwZjh2UE95cXBUUVpGVkJOWG00ZFExaTdXblBLaVZmV2RLUzljRDhQRU16OA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Truth Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Nation Newspaper&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articl